{"id": "p-00045", "text": "Hızlı kargo ürün paketlemesi güzel", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00046", "text": "Televizyonu köydeki evimiz için aldım Alt ayakları biraz kalitesiz duruyor. Cihaz fena değil", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00047", "text": "ürün beklediğimden de iyi çıktı. Nethouse'den aldım. Hızlı gönderdiler.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00048", "text": "Kesinlikle tasarımı sıkıntılı. Sapına ellemek sıcaklığından dolayı mümkün değil. Alırsanız paranız boşa gider.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00049", "text": "Güzel Bir Ürün Fiyat Uygun Boyut Mükemmel.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00050", "text": "Hız azalıyor, ciddi bir menzil artışı sağlamıyor. Kurulumu kolay.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00051", "text": "ÜRÜN GÜZEL,ÇABUK GELDİ,DENEYECEZ GÖRECEZ BAKALIM.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00052", "text": "urun pekledigim gibi cok iyi  suana kadar herhangi bir sıkıntı yasamadim.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00053", "text": "Ürün beklentimizin üzerinde bir performans sağladı kolay kurulunlu ve pratik.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00054", "text": "fiyat-kalite açısından uygun ve alınabilir. eğer kargoda taşınırken bir sıkıntı olmazsa uzun yıllar kullanılabilir.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00055", "text": "sakin ha lg kadar vukuatli telefon markasi yok.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00056", "text": "Fiyat performans olarak oldukça memnun kaldım.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00057", "text": "Özelliklerine bakacak olursanız şu an fiyat/performans olarak alabileceğiniz en iyi bilgisayardır.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00058", "text": "1 ay demedi bozuldu koptu", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00059", "text": "Bence alınabilecek bir modem evde internet çekmeyen yer kalmadı", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00060", "text": "sorunsuz teslim aldım. ertesi gün kurulumu yapıldı", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00061", "text": "Tam bir f/p ürünü. Güzel.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00062", "text": "Piyasada iki katı fiyatla satılıyor. Metal gövdesi sayesinde anahtarlık üzerinde kırılmadan taşınabilir.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00063", "text": "Ürün, sitede belirtildiği gibi en kısa sürede ve sorunsuz olarak teslim edildi. Tüm aşamalarda tarafıma bilgi verildi. Tavsiye ediyorum. Teşekkürler", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00064", "text": "Teşekkürler beklediğimden hafif mis.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00065", "text": "Ev kullanımı için çok ideal,bir yıldır kullanıyorum tüm ihtiyaçlarıma cevap veren bir cihaz.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00066", "text": "kaliteli ürün güzel fiyat hızlı kargo teşekkürler.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00067", "text": "iki gün içinde elime ulaştı ve çok hoş bir kokusu var. Teşekkürler h.b", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00068", "text": "ÜRÜN GÜZEL,ÇABUK GELDİ,DENEYECEZ GÖRECEZ BAKALIM.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00069", "text": "Kötü yorumları anlayamıyorum, parfüm harika. Oldukça kalıcı ve çok hoş kokuyor.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00070", "text": "ÇOK HAFİF YAZIN TERCİH EDİLEBİLİR", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00071", "text": "Ürün gösterildiği gibi paketleme güzeldi. Fakat kargo çok geç geldi ve hepsiexpress ile sorun yaşadım", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00072", "text": "Sorunsuz alinabilir sikintisiz, telefonuda basarili yapmislar.Jelatin olayi biraz zor.Kaplamasi falan zor", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00073", "text": "bildiğimiz brüt kokusu ve hemen kaybolmuyor gayet iyi", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00074", "text": "Celeron N3060 yerine daha iyi ve aynı fiyata N4000 işlemcilsini alın", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00075", "text": "Ürünü aldım güzel isteyen gönül rahatlığıyla alabilir", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00076", "text": "kargo çok iyi ancak ürünü şimdi aldım test edemedim", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00077", "text": "çok iyi karga paketleme ama en azazın dan anahtarlığa rahat  asmak isterdim", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00078", "text": "Kırık çizik yok güzel ambalajlanmış. Windows yükledim. Şimdilik iyi çalışıyor.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00079", "text": "Çok kötü kargo ve müşteri memnuyeti", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00080", "text": "urun gayet iyi kargo cok hizliydi siparis verdikten bi gun sonra elime ulasti ve kurulumu da hemen yapildi tesekurler", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00081", "text": "Ürün hızlı elime geçti. Günlük kullanımda iyi bir parfüm. Hepsiburadaya teşekkürler...", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00082", "text": "Kurulumu kolay çekiminde fena degil", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00083", "text": "ürün ve teslimat çok hızlı", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00084", "text": "Fiyatına göre gerçekten mükemmel ürün", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00085", "text": "Ürünü henüz kullanmaya başlamadım kullanıp göreceğiz, hızlı gönderi ve teslimat için teşekkürler ürün satıcısına hayırlı işler bol kazançlar dilerim.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00086", "text": "sipariş ettim 2.günün sabahında geldi kullanıyorum memnunum öneririm", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
