{"id": "p-00089", "text": "Müthiş bir parfüm. Orijinal kutusunda güvenli paketleme ile 1 gün içinde geldi.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00090", "text": "Ürünü kullanma imkanı buldum, gözünüz kapalı alabilirsiniz.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00091", "text": "Ürün süper, kargo hızlı. Ofisimize aldık evde de 3 yıldır aynı markanın bir üst modelini kullanıyorum. Çok memnunum..", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00092", "text": "efsane cuma kampanyası ile anneme aldım. fiyat-performans olarak gayet iyi bir ürün. tavsiye ederim", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00093", "text": "Fiyatına göre oldukça iyi tavsiye ederim", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00094", "text": "2 gündür kullanıyorum bir problem çıkarmadı, 15m mesafe, 3 oda sonra 1 diş düştü menzili buda gayet normal.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00095", "text": "Ben yandım siz yanmayın kötü ve hiç kalıcı değil kokuyu sıkıp şişesini yerine koyana kadar koku uçup gidiyo", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
{"id": "p-00096", "text": "donma yapıyor, ses çıkışı net değil derinden ve duyulmayacak kadar kısık geliyor. uydu alıcısı berbat. memnun kalmadım.", "label": null, "source": "kamuya_acik_kaynak", "source_name": "UCI Turkish User Review Dataset", "source_url": "https://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/769/turkish+user+review+dataset", "source_license": "CC BY 4.0", "collected_at": "2026-08-25", "labeler_1": null, "labeler_2": null, "labeler_3": null, "final_label": null, "split": null, "notes": ""}
